    {
      "name": "A/52 比特流解析与帧同步",
      "description": "解析 ATSC A/52 比特流，完成帧同步、头部信息提取（采样率/码率/通道配置）、CRC 校验",
      "evidence": ["liba52/bitstream.c", "liba52/parse.c", "liba52/crc.c", "include/a52.h — a52_syncinfo/a52_crc"]
